{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773850/extras/b53e544c89909e8b7f4ca10ef1076caf.avif?t=1763566350\" width=577 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'The Incredible Adventures of Josh and Connor: The Secrets of Office World' is the introductory title to the series of the same name. Influenced by a love for point &amp; click adventure games, walking simulators and story driven content:  'The Secrets of the Office World' is an FPS with point &amp; click elements set in an original universe where you can explore the many departments of the 'Office World' in dimension inhabited by corporate robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story of the Outlier, a criminal robot serving punishment by being controlled by YOU, the player! See everything through his eyes and experience the latest omnidimensional tech today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773850/extras/9172546435e679f78c179a6f5336f40d.avif?t=1763566350\" width=577 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the Josh &amp; Connor universe, things are not always as they seem. Interact with the world and see how it will react back. Who knows, maybe you'll make a friend or two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here's a handy list for what you can do in 'The Incredible Adventures of Josh and Connor: The Secrets of Office World': </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Walk. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Interact. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot many different types of experimental guns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enagage in meaningful conversations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gaze into the abyss, where the haunting contemplation of life's fleeting meaning casts a shadow over your minimal existence.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Befriend a Pineapple. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or don't.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773850/extras/083fc0e215847d234b9a244f32102cf9.avif?t=1763566350\" width=577 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All in all we believe in making games that reflect our own creative sparks and are true to ourselves. They may not be your traditional type of game or follow the latest trend, but at least we can proudly say we're better than the elegant, yet nondescript rock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is dedicated to our friends, family and everyone who makes our little community special. Thank you for your encouragement, time and energy spent listening to the 49 times we spoke about that one thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773850/extras/bf898b02417304f63304b88585f466d1.avif?t=1763566350\" width=577 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us on Discord if you'd like to be part of the community! c:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773850/extras/18ab2f09b5794505c58866ae6370e2ba.avif?t=1763566350\" width=577 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49 49.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2773850?t=1763566350","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773850/a0b1031d3ed82568e618306b8d2970162e887cfc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763566350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773850/4730a0144b2de7c73654470c72ccc07a5f420f11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763566350","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773850/4730a0144b2de7c73654470c72ccc07a5f420f11/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763566350","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773850/extras/b53e544c89909e8b7f4ca10ef1076caf.avif?t=1763566350\" width=577 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'The Incredible Adventures of Josh and Connor: The Secrets of Office World' is the introductory title to the series of the same name. Influenced by a love for point &amp; click adventure games, walking simulators and story driven content:  'The Secrets of the Office World' is an FPS with point &amp; click elements set in an original universe where you can explore the many departments of the 'Office World' in dimension inhabited by corpo